;\n```\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n$ npm install util-promisify\n```\n\n## API\n\nSee `util.promisify`'s [API docs](https://nodejs.org/api/util.html#util_util_promisify_original).\n\n### promisify(original)\n### (Symbol) promisify.custom\n\nIf available, the Symbol is reexported from node core's `util` module.\n\n## License\n\nMIT\n","maintainers":[{"name":"juliangruber","email":"julian@juliangruber.com"}],"time":{"modified":"2022-06-28T07:12:51.199Z","created":"2017-06-11T08:10:14.275Z","1.0.0":"2017-06-11T08:10:14.275Z","1.0.1":"2017-06-11T08:24:18.677Z","1.0.2":"2017-06-11T08:30:24.126Z","1.0.3":"2017-06-11T08:31:24.266Z","1.1.0":"2017-06-11T08:35:52.661Z","1.1.1":"2017-06-11T08:36:30.012Z","1.1.2":"2017-06-11T08:36:47.591Z","1.1.3":"2017-06-11T08:37:34.880Z","1.1.4":"2017-06-11T08:38:13.632Z","2.0.0":"2017-06-12T13:53:56.109Z","2.1.0":"2017-07-15T10:45:21.842Z","3.0.0":"2021-09-28T07:37:49.758Z"},"homepage":"https://github.com/juliangruber/util-promisify#readme","repository":{"type":"git","url":"git+https://github.com/juliangruber/util-promisify.git"},"bugs":{"url":"https://github.com/juliangruber/util-promisify/issues"},"license":"MIT","readmeFilename":"README.md"}